# MyEnv Clink Readline Configuration
# Named Key Bindings for Portable Windows Navigation:

# 1. Standard Left & Right Arrows -> Move Cursor Character-by-Character (Editing Text)
# (Left and Right arrows are handled natively by Readline for editing text)

# 2. Up & Down Arrows (↑ / ↓) -> History Search Matching Typed Prefix
"Up": history-search-backward
"Down": history-search-forward

# 3. Tab Key -> File, Folder & Directory Completion Menu (Case-Insensitive)
"Tab": clink-completion-popup

# 4. Ctrl+Space / F7 / Ctrl+R -> Interactive Command History Popup Menu
"Control-space": clink-popup-history
"Control-r": clink-popup-history
"F7": clink-popup-history
"F8": history-search-backward
